---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TrustHero from "../components/TrustHero.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer | Claude Model Insights Legal Notice"
  description="Legal disclaimer for Claude Model Insights. Information about our content accuracy, affiliate relationships, AI tool usage, and limitation of liability."
  path="/disclaimer/"
  noindex={true}
>
  <TrustHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Disclaimer"
    subtitle="Legal notice covering content accuracy, affiliations, AI tool usage, and limitation of liability."
    accent="#A3787B"
    meta="Last Updated: May 9, 2026"
  />

  <article class="trust-page">
    <h2>General Information</h2>
    <p>
      Claude Model Insights (claudeopusmodels.com) provides educational and
      informational content about Claude AI models, vibe coding, and
      AI-assisted development. The content on this site is intended for
      general informational purposes and shouldn't be treated as professional
      advice.
    </p>

    <h2>No Affiliation with Anthropic</h2>
    <p>
      Claude Model Insights is an independent publication. We aren't
      affiliated with, endorsed by, or officially connected to Anthropic, PBC
      (the company behind Claude). All product names, trademarks, and
      registered trademarks mentioned on this site are the property of their
      respective owners. "Claude," "Claude Code," "Claude Opus," "Claude
      Sonnet," and "Claude Haiku" are trademarks of Anthropic.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy of Information</h2>
    <p>
      We work hard to ensure accuracy in every article we publish (see our <a
        href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a
      >). However, AI tools and pricing change frequently. Information that
      was accurate on the date of publication may become outdated. We review
      and update articles periodically, but we can't guarantee that every
      detail on this site reflects the absolute latest state of every product
      mentioned.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you find an error, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> so we can
      correct it.
    </p>

    <h2>AI-Assisted Content</h2>
    <p>
      We use Claude and other AI tools as part of our writing process. All
      content is researched, structured, reviewed, fact-checked, and edited
      by a human before publication. We don't publish raw AI output without
      human oversight. See our <a href="/editorial-policy/"
        >editorial policy</a
      > for details.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
    <p>
      As of May 2026, this site contains no affiliate links and has no paid
      relationships with any company. If this changes in the future,
      affiliate links will be clearly disclosed in the relevant content.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      The information on this site is provided "as is" without warranties of
      any kind. We aren't liable for any losses or damages arising from the
      use of information on this site, including but not limited to code
      generated using methods described in our tutorials, financial decisions
      based on pricing information, or technical issues resulting from
      following our guides.
    </p>

    <h2>Code and Technical Content</h2>
    <p>
      Code examples and technical instructions on this site are provided for
      educational purposes. Always review AI-generated code before deploying
      it to production environments, especially for applications handling
      sensitive data, financial transactions, or personal information.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about this disclaimer, contact us at <a
        href="mailto:contact@claudeopusmodels.com"
        >contact@claudeopusmodels.com</a
      >.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
